    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Late-afternoon tiredness; no fever; weight up</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Clear urine; no flank pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Peristomal skin comfortable</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No breathlessness or cough</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 score 1</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

